@*  QC-TRC Traceability user manual. *@

<div class="help-doc">
    <div>
        <div class="help-h1">QC-TRC · TRACEABILITY</div>
        <div class="help-sub">LOT 추적성 — 코드 스캔 → 상위 WO/아이템 + 하위 LOT/NCR/Hold</div>

        <svg class="help-svg" viewBox="0 0 720 480" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="708" height="468" rx="10" fill="#000" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.18)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect class="hs-region tbar" x="14" y="14" width="692" height="42" fill="#1a0000" stroke="rgba(220,38,38,.35)" />

            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="68" width="692" height="84" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="88" fill="#fca5a5">▼ LOT LOOKUP</text>
            <rect x="28" y="100" width="430" height="40" rx="6" fill="rgba(0,0,0,.4)" stroke="rgba(58,20,20,.6)" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="42" y="124">LOT-2026-0001 or 42</text>
            <rect class="hs-region ok" x="468" y="100" width="120" height="40" />
            <text class="hs-label" x="528" y="126" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:14px;">🔍 TRACE</text>
            <rect class="hs-region" x="598" y="100" width="100" height="40" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="648" y="126" text-anchor="middle">↺ CLEAR</text>
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="78" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="78">1</text>

            <rect class="hs-region" x="14" y="164" width="692" height="264" />
            <text class="hs-sub" x="28" y="184" fill="#fca5a5">▼ GENEALOGY · 5 NODES</text>
            @{
                var kinds = new[] {"LOT","WO","ITEM","NCR","HOLD"};
                var refs = new[] {"42","WO-2026-0529-007","DR-TRM-LH-A1","NCR-25060001","HLD-25060001"};
                var colors = new[] {"#38bdf8","#fbbf24","#a78bfa","#dc2626","#f97316"};
            }
            @for (var i = 0; i < 5; i++)
            {
                var y = 198 + i * 44;
                <g>
                    <rect class="hs-region" x="28" y="@y" width="664" height="36" />
                    <line x1="28" y1="@y" x2="28" y2="@(y+36)" stroke="@colors[i]" stroke-width="4" />
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="42" y="@(y+22)" fill="@colors[i]">@kinds[i]</text>
                    <text class="hs-sub" x="140" y="@(y+22)">@refs[i]</text>
                </g>
            }
            <circle class="hs-num" cx="24" cy="174" r="14" />
            <text class="hs-num-tx" x="24" y="174">2</text>

            <rect class="hs-region nav" x="14" y="432" width="692" height="32" />
        </svg>
    </div>

    <div>
        <div class="help-section-h">▶ STEPS · 단계</div>
        <div class="help-steps">
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">1</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Scan or type a lot code (LotCode like "LOT-2026-0001") or the numeric LotID.</div><div class="help-step-ko">LOT 코드 또는 LotID 입력.</div></div></div>
            <div class="help-step"><div class="help-step-num">2</div><div class="help-step-body"><div class="help-step-en">Genealogy nodes — coloured left border by kind. LOT/WO/ITEM = upstream; NCR/HOLD = quality history attached to the lot.</div><div class="help-step-ko">계보 노드 — 좌측 테두리 색으로 종류 구분. 상위 = WO/아이템 · 하위 = NCR/Hold.</div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-callout info">
            <div class="help-callout-i">💡</div>
            <div class="help-callout-tx">Use this for customer complaint investigation, recall scoping, and root-cause genealogy.<br/><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);">고객 클레임 추적 · 리콜 범위 산정 · 근본원인 계보 분석.</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
